WEBVTT

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:05.060
Dum da da da-dum da, da-dum da da-dum.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.560
The green walnuts are blown off the trees.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.240
The sour quinces are blown off the trees.

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:13.680
Dum da da da-dum da, da-dum da da-dum.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:19.040
Matsuburo of the Wind

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:19.040
Kenji Miyazawa

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:18.200
On the banks of a mountain stream, there was a humble school.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:23.040
The school had but one room, and though there were none in the third grade,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.690
there were children from the first through sixth grades.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:30.950
The school had only a tennis court for its sports grounds,

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:35.060
but directly behind the school was a beautiful,
green mountain, with chestnut trees growing upon it.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.100
Okay, that's enough.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.190
Thank you.

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:40.670
Continue reading from where
she left off, Maeda-kun.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.350
Stop staring at Niimi-san and focus on class.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:47.150
S-Sorry!

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:32.420
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.920
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:42.680
<i>That's what happened when I saw Niimi Haruka
kneeling on the floor in the middle of the corridor.</i>

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.930
Niimi-san? What's wrong?

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:47.000
Oh, Maeda-kun.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.680
I just felt kinda dizzy.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.780
Are you okay?

00:02:49.780 --> 00:02:52.610
Y-Yeah, I'm okay.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:01.900
This happens once in a while.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.680
It's probably anemia.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.980
It'll pass if I stay like this for a while.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.520
No, I think you should lie down.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:09.830
Let's head to the infirmary.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.520
You'll take me there?

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:12.830
Of course!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.680
I'll carry you on my back.

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:15.500
Okay.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.840
S-Sorry!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.720
Here, get on.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:27.680
Okay.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.240
<i>How stupid am I?!</i>

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.110
<i>Who'd pick someone up by their armpits?</i>

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.360
Am I heavy?

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.920
Nope, not at all.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.080
I was just getting a better hold.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:43.320
That's good.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.660
I was afraid you'd say I was heavy.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.830
Sheesh, you shouldn't be worrying about that right now.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.580
Thanks for carrying me here.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.520
You should skip practice today.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.660
I'll ask Kanon to excuse you.

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.320
But I have to go...

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.020
Just get some rest.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.040
I'll walk you home afterwards.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.080
Really?

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:05.930
Yeah.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:09.600
Okay, I'll take it easy for today then.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.000
That asshole!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.490
Who takes photos of a sick girl?

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.240
He saw me?!

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.080
I don't mind.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:35.630
You haven't really taken many
photos of me sleeping, right?

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.000
It's fine. Just get some rest.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.090
You don't have to worry about modeling for me.

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.970
Okay.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:51.850
Sorry!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.480
You okay?

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.940
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.020
Can you get up?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.820
What's wrong?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.800
N-Nothing.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:15.820
<i>Looking back, that was when
I started thinking of her as a girl.</i>

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:20.500
Okay. Okay.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.840
Got it. I'll let them know.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.420
Bye, then.

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.380
Niiyan, take good care of her, okay?

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.350
I was really happy today.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.120
You were by my side the whole time.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.960
There's no need to worry, okay?

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:38.850
Okay.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.860
Take photos of me again sometime.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:44.640
It's embarrassing, but I'll do my best for your sake.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:47.110
Let me know whenever you want photos of me.

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:48.600
Niimi-san...

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:51.180
Thanks for walking home with me.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:52.820
See you, Maeda-kun.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:55.120
Okay, take care.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.210
I will!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.220
<i>I'm happy Niimi-san feels that way,</i>

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:19.350
<i>but I don't have that confidence.</i>

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:24.980
<i>The kind no one can ruin...</i>

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.240
<i>The kind no one can shake...</i>

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:31.740
<i>The kind of confidence I can be proud of.</i>

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.120
Hey, what do you think?

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.210
It's ridiculous.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.920
Well, to each their own.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.640
You're talking about Maeda, right?

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:48.760
He's around Haruka pretty often these days, but they're totally unbalanced as a couple.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.380
I know, right?

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.890
It's like, so totally wrong.

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:55.010
It's so weird how they're childhood friends.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:59.230
It'd be different if he grew up to be good looking, but I dunno about him <i>now</i>.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.520
Haruka could've gotten someone way better. What a waste.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.900
She should just leave Maeda alone.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.820
Hey, keep it down you two.

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:14.370
And you didn't need to go that far.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.830
Well, if you were her, wouldn't
you go for a more handsome guy?

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.230
Should we forget about the mags?

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.520
Yeah.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:49.990
Yeah.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:53.800
<i>It's exactly like what happened in middle school.</i>

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.160
<i>Those damn rumors again.</i>

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:01.500
<i>I knew this sort of thing would happen.</i>

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.750
Close the door after you.

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:06.500
<i>They'd make fun of me and say I'm not worthy of her.</i>

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:14.640
Hey, I heard from some girls in my class that you've got this childhood friend.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:17.820
He's in your class, and you spend a lot of time together, right?

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.440
You mean Maeda-kun?

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.560
Yeah, we're always together.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.420
Always, huh? Bad news for me.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.890
You guys dating?

00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:29.880
We're not, but I—

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.490
I see. That's good.

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:36.370
Niimi-san, why don't you forget about him and go out with me instead?

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.540
G-Go out with you?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:44.410
I'm the ace striker of the Soccer Club, and you're the ace of the Tennis Club.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.960
I think we'd be a great match.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.380
You don't like me?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.140
It's not that I like or dislike you.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:51.960
I—

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:54.560
Well, you don't have to give me an answer right now.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:55.680
Think it over.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.980
Hey, wait!

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.100
Maeda-kun.

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:08.500
There's nothing going on between him and me.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.480
We only talk once in a while at school.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.240
He's not my friend or anything.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.570
Nothing wrong with him.

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.380
Huh?

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.670
You guys match.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:20.330
Everyone would agree that he suits you better than me.

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:23.330
Maeda-kun, what are you saying?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.960
Why would you say that?

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:35.340
I have no idea what your feelings are.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.660
You idiot!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.690
There you are, Niiyan.

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.920
Maeda Kanon! In that outfit too!

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.100
Where's Haru-chan?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.330
You're looking for Haruka-tan?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.410
Yeah.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.910
Wouldn't Niimi-san be at practice?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.670
No, she's been a no-show pretty often these days.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:53.420
Even when she does show up, she seems really down.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:56.480
And she skipped practice today without telling anyone.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.740
I wonder what's wrong with Haru-chan.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.300
She's not answering her phone, either.

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.100
She's not answering her phone?

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:09.940
What if Niimi-san's had another attack?!

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.840
Did something happen, Niiyan?

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:14.060
Give me Niimi-san's number!

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:14.630
Huh?

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.190
O-Okay.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:26.330
No answer.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.500
One more time.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:41.980
Niiyan! Wait!

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:46.390
What's up with him?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.740
Urgent orders!

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.460
Attention all Photography and Photo Club members!

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:55.650
Requesting assistance for Maeda Kazuya!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.000
Find Niimi Haruka!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.320
Ensure the safety of Miss Photogenic immediately!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.160
Hey, did you catch that thing on TV yesterday?

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.100
That was <i>totally</i> messed up!

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.000
Like, I can't believe—

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:15.500
Hey, you!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.840
Have you... Have you seen Niimi-san?!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.120
N-No.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.090
Okay.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.090
Thanks!

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:24.470
What's up with him?

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:25.900
What an idiot!

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.640
Quit freaking people out like that, geez!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.200
There is not a speck of indecency in us.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:54.580
Our club will do whatever it takes to protect
the beauty of Miss Photogenic, Niimi Haruka!

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.480
Come on, let's keep playing!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:21.230
<i>That's right. I hit her with my elbow.</i>

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:25.740
I'm okay now.

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:30.740
L-Let's stop playing soccer together.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.620
Why?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.750
Why don't you want to play with me anymore?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.480
Well, we're not kids anymore.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:40.380
A guy and a girl shouldn't play together at our age.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.460
But I want to play soccer!

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.200
That's why you won't let me play?

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.780
Why not just join a girls' soccer team?

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:50.390
I bet you'll be their best player!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.160
What's the point in that?!

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.310
I just...

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.140
I just...

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.100
I don't care anymore!

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.970
Hey, come out of there already!

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.820
The sun's setting.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:30.930
Shut up!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.980
Just go home without me!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.140
Wait, are you crying?

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:37.230
I'm not crying!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:43.400
If I can't be with you, I'll be all alone.

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:48.900
I said I can model for you.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.070
It's embarrassing, but I'll do my best.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.080
Then do it!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.580
Take photos of me.

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:59.420
If you're fine with it, I'd like you to take photos of me.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.590
I'm doing this only for you, Maeda-kun.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.380
I'm glad for you, Maeda-kun.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:09.720
For discovering photography.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:34.900
<i>It's my fault.</i>

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.030
<i>I'm an idiot.</i>

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:37.930
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:39.660
<i>I didn't understand anything.</i>

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.670
<i>How she really felt...</i>

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:46.170
<i>or even how I really felt!</i>

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.920
<i>But I can't hide it anymore!</i>

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.870
<i>Thank goodness! She's safe!</i>

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:50.880
Mine has been a life of much shame.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:56.430
I can't even guess myself what it must be to live the life of a human being.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:18:06.440
No Longer Human

00:17:56.430 --> 00:18:06.440
Dazai and Kawabata

00:17:56.810 --> 00:18:00.240
I was born in a village in the Northeast,

00:18:00.240 --> 00:18:05.140
and it wasn't until I was quite big that I saw my first train.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:09.940
I climbed up and down the station bridge,

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:17.600
quite unaware that its function was to permit people to cross from one track to another.

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:22.780
I was convinced that the bridge had
been provided to lend an exotic touch

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:30.580
and to make the station premises a place of
pleasant diversity, like some foreign playground.

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:34.590
I remained under this delusion for quite a long time...

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:41.850
Haruka.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.820
Got a minute?

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:46.310
Y-Yeah.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.390
I'll buy you a drink.

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.340
Here.

00:18:51.340 --> 00:18:52.770
Thank you.

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.740
Man, it's still so hot.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.680
Yeah.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:00.980
I heard you've been skipping practice. Something happen?

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:03.680
You didn't come to the last basic training either.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:05.920
Sorry.

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:10.200
You're not the only one.

00:19:10.200 --> 00:19:11.000
Huh?

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.640
Listen, Haruka.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:16.250
You're not the only one who
can't express your own feelings.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.840
Try to understand that.

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:20.260
What do you mean?

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:24.360
You might not know, but someone out there's working himself to death.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:27.340
Someone out there's willing to go the extra mile for you.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:32.770
Someone out there's doing his best to stop
people from taking indecent pictures of you.

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:47.790
Haruru!

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:50.370
Nono-chan?

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:52.500
Thanks again for this.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:53.840
I'll give it lots of love.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:03.040
I heard you've been skipping practice.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.680
Yeah, I have.

00:20:05.190 --> 00:20:07.180
Everyone's worried about you.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.860
From your expression, I bet it's about Darts'un.

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:12.160
I...

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.560
You should trust Darts'un.

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:17.690
H-Huh?

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:22.200
You know him better than I do, don't you?

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:24.280
Okay?

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:36.600
Good evening!

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:38.240
Haru-chan, you okay?

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:41.080
Actually, Niiyan still hasn't come home.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:44.050
Could you let me know if he calls you?

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:47.060
Sorry Niiyan's so unreliable.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:48.740
Give him a little more time.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.730
Haruka, how are you?

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.360
Kanon's really worried for you.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:21:01.690
Do try to sort your feelings out and come back soon so your juniors can stop worrying about you.

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:08.720
Haruka, I think I may have been a bit too rough on you today.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:12.330
But you should trust Maeda-kun and your own feelings.

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:18.100
Haruka-senpai, I look forward to
doing basic training with you again.

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:19.360
We're all waiting for you.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:24.520
Niimi-san, let's make sandwiches again sometime!

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:26.160
We'll make some for Maeda-kun too!

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:33.260
It's not good to hide your feelings.

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:52.360
I'm waiting for you at the place of our memories.

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:54.860
Please, give me a second chance.

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:42.100
Niimi Haruka.

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:44.880
Beautiful looks and a bright personality.

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:47.100
The heroine of the school,
loved by both boys and girls alike.

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:50.860
Born on October 6th. Libra. Blood type O.

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:50.860
Return Utensils Here

00:23:50.860 --> 00:23:54.980
Bust, neither too large nor too small. The perfect shape.

00:23:55.490 --> 00:23:57.990
Hips, slightly smaller than her bust.

00:23:58.510 --> 00:24:00.220
Yes... Beautiful!

00:24:00.220 --> 00:24:02.440
Truly photogenic!

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:03.960
Go, Maeda!

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:05.900
Never give up!

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:09.320
Let your heart's stealth run free.
